, 976, 640, 356, 760, 340, 460, 470, 13, 50937], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13337008507697137, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 0.003383937291800976}, {"id": 37, "seek": 16580, "start": 177.28, "end": 181.56, "text": " So we trick our brains because our brain simply doesn't accept the fact that it doesn't really", "tokens": [50937, 1406, 356, 6908, 674, 14290, 780, 674, 3632, 2391, 1595, 470, 2453, 262, 1109, 326, 340, 1595, 470, 1107, 51151], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13337008507697137, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 0.003383937291800976}, {"id": 38, "seek": 16580, "start": 181.56, "end": 183.48000000000002, "text": " make sense.", "tokens": [51151, 787, 2565, 13, 51247], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13337008507697137, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 0.003383937291800976}, {"id": 39, "seek": 16580, "start": 183.48000000000002, "end": 188.52, "text": " And I see the same process with combining photographs.", "tokens": [51247, 843, 314, 766, 262, 976, 1429, 351, 19771, 12566, 13, 51499], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13337008507697137, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 0.003383937291800976}, {"id": 40, "seek": 16580, "start": 188.52, "end": 192.84, "text": " It's just really about combining different realities.", "tokens": [51499, 632, 338, 655, 1107, 546, 19771, 1180, 22072, 13, 51715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13337008507697137, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 0.003383937291800976}, {"id": 41, "seek": 19284, "start": 192.84, "end": 197.04, "text": " So the things that make a photograph look realistic.", "tokens": [50363, 1406, 262, 1243, 326, 787, 257, 8408, 804, 12653, 13, 50573], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12890457412571582, "compression_ratio": 1.6561264822134387, "no_speech_prob": 0.006855477578938007}, {"id": 42, "seek": 19284, "start": 197.04, "end": 199.4, "text": " I think it's the things that we don't even think about.", "tokens": [50573, 314, 892, 340, 338, 262, 1243, 326, 356, 836, 470, 772, 892, 546, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12890457412571582, "compression_ratio": 1.6561264822134387, "no_speech_prob": 0.006855477578938007}, {"id": 43, "seek": 19284, "start": 199.4, "end": 204.12, "text": " The things all around us in our daily lives.", "tokens": [50691, 383, 1243, 477, 1088, 514, 287, 674, 4445, 3160, 13, 50927], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12890457412571582, "compression_ratio": 1.6561264822134387, "no_speech_prob": 0.006855477578938007}, {"id": 44, "seek": 19284, "start": 204.12, "end": 208.22, "text": " But when combining photographs, this is really important to consider.", "tokens": [50927, 887, 618, 19771, 12566, 11, 428, 318, 1107, 1593, 284, 2074, 13, 51132], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12890457412571582, "compression_ratio": 1.6561264822134387, "no_speech_prob": 0.006855477578938007}, {"id": 45, "seek": 19284, "start": 208.22, "end": 212.12, "text": " Because otherwise it just looks wrong somehow.", "tokens": [51132, 4362, 4306, 340, 655, 3073, 2642, 7599, 13, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12890457412571582, "compression_ratio": 1.6561264822134387, "no_speech_prob": 0.006855477578938007}, {"id": 46, "seek": 19284, "start": 212.12, "end": 216.2, "text": " So I would like to say that there are three simple rules to follow to achieve a realistic", "tokens": [51327, 1406, 314, 561, 588, 284, 910, 326, 612, 389, 1115, 2829, 3173, 284, 1061, 284, 4620, 257, 12653, 51531], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12890457412571582, "compression_ratio": 1.6561264822134387, "no_speech_prob": 0.006855477578938007}, {"id": 47, "seek": 19284, "start": 216.2, "end": 218.72, "text": " result.", "tokens": [51531, 1255, 13, 51657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12890457412571582, "compression_ratio": 1.6561264822134387, "no_speech_prob": 0.006855477578938007}, {"id": 48, "seek": 19284, "start": 218.72, "end": 221.3, "text": " As you can see these images aren't really special.", "tokens": [51657, 1081, 345, 460, 766, 777, 4263, 3588, 470, 1107, 2041, 13, 51786], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12890457412571582, "compression_ratio": 1.6561264822134387, "no_speech_prob": 0.006855477578938007}, {"id": 49, "seek": 22130, "start": 221.3, "end": 227.66000000000003, "text": " But combined they can create something like this.", "tokens": [50363, 887, 5929, 484, 460, 2251, 1223, 588, 428, 13, 50681], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13496317034182342, "compression_ratio": 1.8310502283105023, "no_speech_prob": 0.015016525983810425}, {"id": 50, "seek": 22130, "start": 227.66000000000003, "end": 232.18, "text": " So the first rule is that photos combined should have the same perspective.", "tokens": [50681, 1406, 262, 717, 3896, 318, 326, 5205, 5929, 815, 423, 262, 976, 6650, 13, 50907], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13496317034182342, "compression_ratio": 1.8310502283105023, "no_speech_prob": 0.015016525983810425}, {"id": 51, "seek": 22130, "start": 232.18, "end": 237.46, "text": " Secondly, photos combined should have the same type of light.", "tokens": [50907, 34276, 11, 5205, 5929, 815, 423, 262, 976, 2099, 286, 1657, 13, 51171], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13496317034182342, "compression_ratio": 1.8310502283105023, "no_speech_prob": 0.015016525983810425}, {"id": 52, "seek": 22130, "start": 237.46, "end": 240.3, "text": " And these two images both fulfill these two requirements.", "tokens": [51171, 843, 777, 734, 4263, 1111, 14658, 777, 734, 5359, 13, 51313], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13496317034182342, "compression_ratio": 1.8310502283105023, "no_speech_prob": 0.015016525983810425}, {"id": 53, "seek": 22130, "start": 240.3, "end": 244.3, "text": " Shot at the same height and in the same type of light.", "tokens": [51313, 13590, 379, 262, 976, 6001, 290, 287, 262, 976, 2099, 286, 1657, 13, 51513], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13496317034182342, "compression_ratio": 1.8310502283105023, "no_speech_prob": 0.015016525983810425}, {"id": 54, "seek": 22130, "start": 244.3, "end": 248.74, "text": " The third one is about making it impossible to distinguish where the different images", "tokens": [51513, 383, 2368, 530, 318, 546, 1642, 340, 5340, 284, 15714, 810, 262, 1180, 4263, 51735], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13496317034182342, "compression_ratio": 1.8310502283105023, "no_speech_prob": 0.015016525983810425}, {"id": 55, "seek": 22130, "start": 248.74, "end": 250.52, "text": " begin and end.", "tokens": [51735, 2221, 290, 886, 13, 51824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13496317034182342, "compression_ratio": 1.8310502283105023, "no_speech_prob": 0.015016525983810425}, {"id": 56, "seek": 25052, "start": 250.52, "end": 252.92000000000002, "text": " By making it seamless.", "tokens": [50363, 2750, 1642, 340, 32354, 13, 50483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17712511514362536, "compression_ratio": 1.6847290640394088, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014452239265665412}, {"id": 57, "seek": 25052, "start": 252.92000000000002, "end": 257.44, "text": " Make it impossible to say how the image actually was composed.", "tokens": [50483, 6889, 340, 5340, 284, 910, 703, 262, 2939, 1682, 373, 13160, 13, 50709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17712511514362536, "compression_ratio": 1.6847290640394088, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014452239265665412}, {"id": 58, "seek": 25052, "start": 257.44, "end": 263.44, "text": " So by matching color, contrast and brightness in the borders between the different images.", "tokens": [50709, 1406, 416, 12336, 3124, 11, 6273, 290, 22204, 287, 262, 11637, 1022, 262, 1180, 4263, 13, 51009], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17712511514362536, "compression_ratio": 1.6847290640394088, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014452239265665412}, {"id": 59, "seek": 25052, "start": 263.44, "end": 270.36, "text": " Adding photographic defects like depth of field, desaturated colors and noise.", "tokens": [51009, 18247, 35788, 22448, 588, 6795, 286, 2214, 11, 748, 30192, 7577, 290, 7838, 13, 51355], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17712511514362536, "compression_ratio": 1.6847290640394088, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014452239265665412}, {"id": 60, "seek": 25052, "start": 270.36, "end": 275.28000000000003, "text": " Erase the borders between the different images and make it look like one single image.", "tokens": [51355, 5256, 589, 262, 11637, 1022, 262, 1180, 4263, 290, 787, 340, 804, 588, 530, 2060, 2939, 13, 51601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17712511514362536, "compression_ratio": 1.6847290640394088, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014452239265665412}, {"id": 61, "seek": 27528, "start": 275.28, "end": 280.71999999999997, "text": " Despite the fact that one image can contain hundreds of layers basically.", "tokens": [50363, 7945, 262, 1109, 326, 530, 2939, 460, 3994, 5179, 286, 11685, 6209, 13, 50635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15842372669893154, "compression_ratio": 1.5991379310344827, "no_speech_prob": 0.15252891182899475}, {"id": 62, "seek": 27528, "start": 280.71999999999997, "end": 286.28, "text": " So here's another example.", "tokens": [50635, 1406, 994, 338, 1194, 1672, 13, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15842372669893154, "compression_ratio": 1.5991379310344827, "no_speech_prob": 0.15252891182899475}, {"id": 63, "seek": 27528, "start": 286.28, "end": 290.11999999999995, "text": " One might think that this is just an image of a landscape and the lower part is what's", "tokens": [50913, 1881, 1244, 892, 326, 428, 318, 655, 281, 2939, 286, 257, 10747, 290, 262, 2793, 636, 318, 644, 338, 51105], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15842372669893154, "compression_ratio": 1.5991379310344827, "no_speech_prob": 0.15252891182899475}, {"id": 64, "seek": 27528, "start": 290.11999999999995, "end": 291.76, "text": " manipulated.", "tokens": [51105, 25036, 13, 51187], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15842372669893154, "compression_ratio": 1.5991379310344827, "no_speech_prob": 0.15252891182899475}, {"id": 65, "seek": 27528, "start": 291.76, "end": 297.79999999999995, "text": " But this image is actually entirely composed of photographs from different locations.", "tokens": [51187, 887, 428, 2939, 318, 1682, 5000, 13160, 286, 12566, 422, 1180, 7064, 13, 51489], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15842372669893154, "compression_ratio": 1.5991379310344827, "no_speech_prob": 0.15252891182899475}, {"id": 66, "seek": 27528, "start": 297.79999999999995, "end": 302.96, "text": " I personally think that it's easier to actually create a place than to find a place.", "tokens": [51489, 314, 7620, 892, 326, 340, 338, 4577, 284, 1682, 2251, 257, 1295, 621, 284, 1064, 257, 1295, 13, 51747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15842372669893154, "compression_ratio": 1.5991379310344827, "no_speech_prob": 0.15252891182899475}, {"id": 67, "seek": 30296, "start": 302.96, "end": 306.96, "text": " Because then you don't need to compromise with the ideas in your head.", "tokens": [50363, 4362, 788, 345, 836, 470, 761, 284, 13110, 351, 262, 4213, 287, 534, 1182, 13, 50563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15053513026473545, "compression_ratio": 1.6558704453441295, "no_speech_prob": 0.11271321773529053}, {"id": 68, "seek": 30296, "start": 306.96, "end": 310.59999999999997, "text": " But it does require a lot of planning.", "tokens": [50563, 887, 340, 857, 2421, 257, 1256, 286, 5410, 13, 50745], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15053513026473545, "compression_ratio": 1.6558704453441295, "no_speech_prob": 0.11271321773529053}, {"id": 69, "seek": 30296, "start": 310.59999999999997, "end": 313.84, "text": " And getting this idea during winter, I knew that I had several months to plan it.", "tokens": [50745, 843, 1972, 428, 2126, 1141, 7374, 11, 314, 2993, 326, 314, 550, 1811, 1933, 284, 1410, 340, 13, 50907], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15053513026473545, "compression_ratio": 1.6558704453441295, "no_speech_prob": 0.11271321773529053}, {"id": 70, "seek": 30296, "start": 313.84, "end": 318.96, "text": " To find the different locations for the pieces for the puzzle basically.", "tokens": [50907, 1675, 1064, 262, 1180, 7064, 329, 262, 5207, 329, 262, 15027, 6209, 13, 51163], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15053513026473545, "compression_ratio": 1.6558704453441295, "no_speech_prob": 0.11271321773529053}, {"id": 71, "seek": 30296, "start": 318.96, "end": 323.64, "text": " So for example the fish is captured on a fishing trip.", "tokens": [51163, 1406, 329, 1672, 262, 5916, 318, 7907, 319, 257, 12478, 5296, 13, 51397], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15053513026473545, "compression_ratio": 1.6558704453441295, "no_speech_prob": 0.11271321773529053}, {"id": 72, "seek": 30296, "start": 323.64, "end": 325.52, "text": " The shores are from a different location.", "tokens": [51397, 383, 29963, 389, 422, 257, 1180, 4067, 13, 51491], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15053513026473545, "compression_ratio": 1.6558704453441295, "no_speech_prob": 0.11271321773529053}, {"id": 73, "seek": 30296, "start": 325.52, "end": 328.76, "text": " The underwater part is captured in a stone pit.", "tokens": [51491, 383, 21258, 636, 318, 7907, 287, 257, 7815, 6028, 13, 51653], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15053513026473545, "compression_ratio": 1.6558704453441295, "no_speech_prob": 0.11271321773529053}, {"id": 74, "seek": 32876, "start": 328.76, "end": 334.68, "text": " And I even turned the house on top of the island red to make it look more Swedish.", "tokens": [50363, 843, 314, 772, 2900, 262, 2156, 319, 1353, 286, 262, 7022, 2266, 284, 787, 340, 804, 517, 14023, 13, 50659], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11368066706555954, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 0.03726813197135925}, {"id": 75, "seek": 32876, "start": 334.68, "end": 339.84, "text": " So to achieve a realistic result, I think it comes down to planning.", "tokens": [50659, 1406, 284, 4620, 257, 12653, 1255, 11, 314, 892, 340, 2058, 866, 284, 5410, 13, 50917], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11368066706555954, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 0.03726813197135925}, {"id": 76, "seek": 32876, "start": 339.84, "end": 343.88, "text": " It always starts with a sketch, an idea.", "tokens": [50917, 632, 1464, 4940, 351, 257, 17548, 11, 281, 2126, 13, 51119], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11368066706555954, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 0.03726813197135925}, {"id": 77, "seek": 32876, "start": 343.88, "end": 347.4, "text": " Then it's about combining the different photographs.", "tokens": [51119, 3244, 340, 338, 546, 19771, 262, 1180, 12566, 13, 51295], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11368066706555954, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 0.03726813197135925}, {"id": 78, "seek": 32876, "start": 347.4, "end": 350.28, "text": " And here every piece is very well planned.", "tokens": [51295, 843, 994, 790, 3704, 318, 845, 880, 6027, 13, 51439], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11368066706555954, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 0.03726813197135925}, {"id": 79, "seek": 32876, "start": 350.28, "end": 355.71999999999997, "text": " And if you do a good job capturing the photos, the result can be quite beautiful.", "tokens": [51439, 843, 611, 345, 466, 257, 922, 1693, 21430, 262, 5205, 11, 262, 1255, 460, 307, 2407, 4950, 13, 51711], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11368066706555954, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 0.03726813197135925}, {"id": 80, "seek": 35572, "start": 355.72, "end": 358.8, "text": " And also quite realistic.", "tokens": [50363, 843, 635, 2407, 12653, 13, 50517], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.28259617573506124, "compression_ratio": 1.22, "no_speech_prob": 0.02978125773370266}, {"id": 81, "seek": 35572, "start": 358.8, "end": 362.8, "text": " So all the tools are out there.", "tokens": [50517, 1406, 477, 262, 4899, 389, 503, 612, 13, 50717], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.28259617573506124, "compression_ratio": 1.22, "no_speech_prob": 0.02978125773370266}, {"id": 82, "seek": 35572, "start": 362.8, "end": 370.76000000000005, "text": " And the only thing that limits us is our imagination.", "tokens": [50717, 843, 262, 691, 1517, 326, 7095, 514, 318, 674, 13843, 13, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.28259617573506124, "compression_ratio": 1.22, "no_speech_prob": 0.02978125773370266}, {"id": 83, "seek": 35572, "start": 370.76000000000005, "end": 371.76000000000005, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [51115, 6952, 345, 13, 51165], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.28259617573506124, "compression_ratio": 1.22, "no_speech_prob": 0.02978125773370266}, {"id": 84, "seek": 37176, "start": 371.76, "end": 372.76, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [50363, 6952, 345, 13, 50413], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.7056521502408114, "compression_ratio": 1.0, "no_speech_prob": 0.9931713342666626}, {"id": 85, "seek": 37176, "start": 372.76, "end": 372.78, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [50413, 6952, 345, 13, 50414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.7056521502408114, "compression_ratio": 1.0, "no_speech_prob": 0.9931713342666626}], "language": "en"}